  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2019 FCDO has supported reform of the property tax system in Freetown. The project has identified and valued every property in the city, constructed a new IT system for property tax administration, developed a new bank payment system, invested in popular outreach, created appeals process and supported participatory budgeting and broader capacity building with the City Council.</narrative>
  </description>
